urated element against the black field.\",\n    \"elements\": [\n      {\n        \"type\": \"obj\",\n        \"desc\": \"Donald Trump caricature rendered as a furry character, head-and-shoulders filling roughly 70% of the frame, centered, in three-quarter front view angled slightly to camera-left, facing the camera. Glowing peach-blond fur sculpted into Pixar-style stylized clumps with individually defined strands grouped into readable tufts, subsurface warmth throughout. Signature swept-back hairstyle with soft tufted strands catching highlights along the crown and sideburns. Large round white eyes with prominent dark pupils, glossy specular catchlights, subtle rim light along the iris edges, gaze directed at the camera. Bushy dark eyebrows arched low over the eyes, dense individual hairs visible, slightly furrowed into a grumpy-but-innocent squint. Characteristic pursed lips and small upturned nose beneath the brows, faint stubble texture across the jawline in matching fur. Hyperreal micro-detail in skin-fur transition around the mouth and ears. Deep navy suit lapel just visible at the shoulders, red necktie peeking at the lower edge of the frame.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 236, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 168, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.8.2", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 13}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.44.19", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [-7354.126190896239, 120.4765987